            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the URL enclosed in double quotes. After successful authentication with OAuth2 provider, it makes a redirect to this path so that the platform can do further log in processing. This URL may be configured as 'security.oauth2.loginProcessingUrl' property in yml configuration file, or as 'SECURITY_OAUTH2_LOGIN_PROCESSING_URL' env variable. By default it is '/login/oauth2/code/'\n\nAvailable for users with 'SYS_ADMIN' or 'TENANT_ADMIN' authority.",
